  <section class="reminder">
    <h2>Simple Reminder</h2>
    <p>A good contractor should make the process clearer, not more confusing.</p>
    <p>Before you sign, pay, or let anyone start work, slow down.</p>
    <p>Verify the license.</p>
    <p>Read the scope.</p>
    <p>Understand the exclusions.</p>
    <p>Ask about permits.</p>
    <p>Ask about change orders.</p>
    <p>Know what you are paying for.</p>
    <p>The goal is not to become difficult.</p>
    <p>The goal is to avoid becoming defenseless.</p>
  </section>

